<launch>
  <!--
    실제 EKF 트래커(jaeyoungjo99/ekf-multi-object-tracking) 기반 전체 파이프라인.
    GT -> jsk bridge -> EKF tracker -> ekf_tracking_node(포맷 변환) -> prediction.
    tracking_and_prediction.launch(dummy tracking)의 실차 트래커 버전.

    주의: rosbag 재생 시 반드시 clock 옵션(rosbag play의 clock 발행 옵션)이 필요함
    (ekf_multi_class_object_tracking.launch가 use_sim_time:=true를 요구함).
  -->
  <include file="$(find tracking_prediction)/launch/gt_to_jsk_bridge.launch" />
  <include file="$(find ekf_multi_object_tracking)/launch/ekf_multi_class_object_tracking.launch" />
  <include file="$(find tracking_prediction)/launch/ekf_tracking.launch" />
  <include file="$(find tracking_prediction)/launch/prediction.launch" />
  <!-- 2026-07-31 추가: 판단/제어용 고rate(20~50Hz) 출력. prediction의 입력에는
       영향 없음(별도 토픽 /tracking/objects_highrate로만 발행) -->
  <include file="$(find tracking_prediction)/launch/extrapolation.launch" />
</launch>
